{
  "name": "Stage 01 - Content Intake and Rights Gate (Demo)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111101",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1400, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 1 demo workflow\nThis workflow is a SAFE, NON-FUNCTIONAL demonstration.\nIt uses only fictitious sample data, calls no external\nservices, publishes nothing, and requires no credentials.\n\nIt models the intake -> rights-gate -> routing logic\ndescribed in docs/03-content-rights-policy.md.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111102",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1420, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "f1", "name": "source_id", "type": "string", "value": "SRC-DEMO-0001" },
            { "id": "f2", "name": "source_url", "type": "string", "value": "https://example.com/demo-source" },
            { "id": "f3", "name": "source_platform", "type": "string", "value": "ExamplePlatform" },
            { "id": "f4", "name": "creator_name", "type": "string", "value": "Demo Creator" },
            { "id": "f5", "name": "video_title", "type": "string", "value": "Example Source Video (Fictitious)" },
            { "id": "f6", "name": "duration_seconds", "type": "number", "value": 1800 },
            { "id": "f7", "name": "rights_status", "type": "string", "value": "VERIFIED" },
            { "id": "f8", "name": "commercial_use_allowed", "type": "boolean", "value": true },
            { "id": "f9", "name": "editing_allowed", "type": "boolean", "value": true },
            { "id": "f10", "name": "platform_use_allowed", "type": "boolean", "value": true },
            { "id": "f11", "name": "authorization_expired", "type": "boolean", "value": false },
            { "id": "f12", "name": "human_review_completed", "type": "boolean", "value": true }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111103",
      "name": "Set Fictitious Source Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-1180, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1) Intake\nManual Trigger simulates a new source being\nregistered. The Set node below fills in\nFICTITIOUS demo fields only - edit these\nvalues to test each branch of the gate.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 300
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111104",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-1200, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "c1", "leftValue": "={{$json.source_id}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } },
            { "id": "c2", "leftValue": "={{$json.source_platform}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } },
            { "id": "c3", "leftValue": "={{$json.creator_name}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } },
            { "id": "c4", "leftValue": "={{$json.rights_status}}", "rightValue": "", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111105",
      "name": "Validate Required Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-940, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "e1", "name": "processing_status", "type": "string", "value": "BLOCKED_INVALID_INTAKE" },
            { "id": "e2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "One or more required intake fields are missing." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111106",
      "name": "Blocked - Invalid Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-700, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "d1", "leftValue": "={{$json.rights_status}}", "rightValue": "VERIFIED", "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "equals" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111107",
      "name": "rights_status = VERIFIED?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-700, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2) Rights gate\nPer docs/03-content-rights-policy.md, a source may\nonly advance if rights_status = VERIFIED AND every\nusage flag below is TRUE. Any other rights_status\n(PENDING_REVIEW, REJECTED, EXPIRED, REVOKED) is\nrouted straight to the rejected/blocked branch.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111108",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Rights Gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-720, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "r1", "name": "processing_status", "type": "string", "value": "BLOCKED_RIGHTS" },
            { "id": "r2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "rights_status is not VERIFIED." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111109",
      "name": "Rejected - BLOCKED_RIGHTS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-460, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "u1", "leftValue": "={{$json.commercial_use_allowed}}", "rightValue": true, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" } },
            { "id": "u2", "leftValue": "={{$json.editing_allowed}}", "rightValue": true, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" } },
            { "id": "u3", "leftValue": "={{$json.platform_use_allowed}}", "rightValue": true, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" } },
            { "id": "u4", "leftValue": "={{$json.authorization_expired}}", "rightValue": false, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "false" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111110",
      "name": "Usage Flags OK?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-460, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3) Additional checks\nEven when rights_status = VERIFIED, this node\nre-checks commercial use, editing, platform use\nand expiry individually - and the next node\nchecks human_review_completed separately - so\nno single stale or mis-set flag can silently\nlet a source through.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Additional Checks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "h1", "leftValue": "={{$json.human_review_completed}}", "rightValue": true, "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111112",
      "name": "Human Review Completed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-220, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "p1", "name": "processing_status", "type": "string", "value": "HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED" },
            { "id": "p2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "One or more usage flags are not TRUE, or authorization has expired." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111113",
      "name": "Pending - Usage Flags",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-220, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "n1", "name": "processing_status", "type": "string", "value": "HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED" },
            { "id": "n2", "name": "block_reason", "type": "string", "value": "human_review_completed is not TRUE." }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111114",
      "name": "Pending - No Human Review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [20, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "a1", "name": "processing_status", "type": "string", "value": "READY_FOR_TRANSCRIPTION" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111115",
      "name": "Approved - READY_FOR_TRANSCRIPTION",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [20, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4) Outcomes\nOnly the top path reaches READY_FOR_TRANSCRIPTION.\nEvery other path ends in either\nHUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED or BLOCKED_RIGHTS /\nBLOCKED_INVALID_INTAKE. Nothing downstream of\nthis workflow (transcription, scoring, clipping,\npublishing) exists yet - see docs/06-roadmap.md.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111116",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Outcomes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "s1", "name": "execution_summary", "type": "string", "value": "={{ 'source_id=' + $json.source_id + ' | processing_status=' + $json.processing_status + ' | reason=' + ($json.block_reason || 'n/a') }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111117",
      "name": "Execution Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [280, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
